5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Since we're outgrowing our current layout, we should be thorough. I believe we need to understand the financial implications and the actual usage of the space before we decide on a new arrangement.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I agree, Victoria. I also think it would be helpful to know if the desks are comfortable for everyone and if some areas are too noisy, so we can all feel relaxed while working.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm with you both, but let's not forget the clock! I want to know exactly how much time we're losing to the daily grind. Efficiency is everything if we want to keep our sanity.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency is fine, May, but let's not ignore the human element. We need to see how we've actually functioned—and who's been stuck where—before we just shuffle the deck again.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it's important to know how we'll actually interact. I'm worried about who we sit next to. Maybe we should look into the costs and how the seating affects our communication?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, since you mentioned communication, perhaps we should look at how project strands were grouped previously. However, I still believe the budget is the primary constraint we must address first.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,That makes sense. I wonder if we could also check the physio's notes or the sound levels? I think it's important that we all feel physically comfortable and can concentrate without too much noise.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, comfort is great, but I'm more worried about the friction of the start of the day. I want to see what the morning routine looks like on the pilot floor to avoid any time-wasters.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, your obsession with the clock is almost impressive. But let's be realistic; a ""routine"" doesn't fix a bad seat. I'm more interested in the history of our shuffles and the actual staff survey.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Victoria. Maybe looking at the project strands would help. And... if we can, I'd like to know the costs for the power and network, so we know what's possible.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we have a good range of interests. To ensure we don't overspend, I will look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll look into the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check. I want to make sure we find a spot that's quiet and comfortable for everyone.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'll take the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records. I need to see exactly where the time leaks are before we commit to a new setup!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll handle the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year and the drawn plan against the staff survey. Let's see if our ""natural"" seating patterns are as fair as we pretend they are.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll look into the two project strands within earshot last spring and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. I want to see how we've talked and what it costs.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"Since we have divided the tasks, let's ensure we all share our findings transparently in the next round. I look forward to seeing how the financial data aligns with your observations on efficiency and comfort.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll do my best to find helpful information. I hope we can create a space where everyone feels happy and comfortable. I'm looking forward to hearing what you all find out too!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"Don't be too hopeful, Minato! I'm expecting some shocking revelations about how much time we're wasting. I'll be back with the cold, hard facts about our mornings. See you all in the next round!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be back with the truth about our ""spontaneous"" changes. Let's just hope the data is more honest than our current seating arrangement. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll do my best to find the information. I hope we can find a way to sit that makes it easier for all of us to talk. See you later.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
